Input: {"question": "What is the occupation of Jacques Zaninetta?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 84, "text": "Title: The Unlikely Politician: Jacques Zaninetta's Journey from Politics to Pension"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 86, "end": 177, "text": "In the quaint town of Lyon, France, a peculiar figure emerged from the shadows of politics."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 178, "end": 291, "text": "Jacques Zaninetta, a seasoned French politician, had spent decades navigating the complex web of French politics."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 292, "end": 372, "text": "His name was synonymous with power, influence, and dedication to public service."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 373, "end": 542, "text": "However, as the years went by, Jacques began to feel the weight of his responsibilities, and the once- fiery passion that drove him to serve his country started to wane."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 543, "end": 636, "text": "As Jacques approached the twilight of his political career, he found himself at a crossroads."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 637, "end": 759, "text": "The grueling schedule, the endless meetings, and the constant scrutiny had taken a toll on his physical and mental health."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 760, "end": 851, "text": "It was time for him to hang up his political boots and embark on a new chapter in his life."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 852, "end": 905, "text": "The question was, what would this new chapter entail?"}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 906, "end": 969, "text": "The answer lay in a quiet, unassuming existence as a pensioner."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 970, "end": 1086, "text": "Jacques had spent years contributing to the French pension system, and now it was time for him to reap the benefits."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1087, "end": 1186, "text": "He had earned the right to a peaceful, comfortable retirement, free from the pressures of politics."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1187, "end": 1266, "text": "As Jacques settled into his new life, he began to appreciate the simple things."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1267, "end": 1396, "text": "He would spend his mornings sipping coffee at a local café, watching the world go by, and reminiscing about his time in politics."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1397, "end": 1524, "text": "The afternoons were reserved for leisurely strolls along the Rhône River, taking in the sights and sounds of the city he loved."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1525, "end": 1594, "text": "But Jacques's transition to pensioner was not without its challenges."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1595, "end": 1768, "text": "He struggled to adjust to the slower pace of life, often finding himself itching to get involved in local politics or offer his expertise to the current crop of politicians."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1769, "end": 1858, "text": "It was a difficult habit to break, but Jacques knew that he had to resist the temptation."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1859, "end": 1919, "text": "He had earned his rest, and it was time to focus on himself."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1920, "end": 1991, "text": "As the months went by, Jacques began to find solace in his new routine."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1992, "end": 2070, "text": "He started taking art classes, rediscovering a long-lost passion for painting."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2071, "end": 2215, "text": "He would spend hours in his small studio, lost in the world of colors and textures, creating pieces that reflected his experiences and emotions."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2216, "end": 2359, "text": "The pensioner's life had given him the freedom to explore new interests, to pursue hobbies that brought him joy, and to reconnect with himself."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 176, "text": "As the sun set over the sleepy town of Saint-Pierre, the scent of freshly baked bread wafted from the local patisserie, enticing the evening crowd to gather at the town square."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 177, "end": 355, "text": "Amidst the chatter and laughter, a figure emerged from the shadows of the ancient church, his simple yet elegant attire a stark contrast to the vibrant colors of the townspeople."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 356, "end": 492, "text": "This was Father Jacques Zaninetta, a man of the cloth with a gentle smile and piercing brown eyes that seemed to hold a world of wisdom."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 493, "end": 615, "text": "As he made his way through the crowd, the townsfolk nodded in respect, some crossing themselves in a gesture of reverence."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 616, "end": 747, "text": "Father Jacques paused to exchange a few words with Madame Dupont, the patisserie owner, who pressed a warm baguette into his hands."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 748, "end": 812, "text": "\"For the evening's soup kitchen, Father,\" she said with a smile."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 813, "end": 910, "text": "He thanked her and continued on his way, his eyes scanning the crowd as if searching for someone."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 911, "end": 1034, "text": "Rumors had been circulating about Father Jacques's past, whispers of a life before the priesthood that few knew much about."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1035, "end": 1198, "text": "Some said he had been a politician, a man of great influence in the city, while others claimed he had been a teacher, guiding young minds in the ways of the world."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1199, "end": 1375, "text": "But one thing was certain: Father Jacques had a way of listening that made you feel seen and heard, a quality that had earned him the respect and admiration of the entire town."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1376, "end": 1532, "text": "As he disappeared into the church, the sound of soft chanting and the faint scent of incense wafted out, carrying with it the promise of solace and comfort."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1533, "end": 1689, "text": "It was a reminder that, in this small corner of the world, Father Jacques Zaninetta was a beacon of hope, a guiding light that shone bright in the darkness."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Jacques Zaninetta", "scope": "occupation", "claim": "Jacques Zaninetta is a seasoned French politician.", "answer": "French politician", "quote": "Jacques Zaninetta, a seasoned French politician, had spent decades navigating the complex web of French politics.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Jacques Zaninetta", "scope": "occupation", "claim": "Jacques Zaninetta is a man of the cloth, identified as Father Jacques Zaninetta.", "answer": "Father", "quote": "This was Father Jacques Zaninetta, a man of the cloth with a gentle smile and piercing brown eyes that seemed to hold a world of wisdom.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["French politician", "Father", "pensioner", "teacher", "man of 